{"title": "Shield of Shielding", "pageid": 13778, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shield_of_Shielding", "categories": ["Shields", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png/300px-Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/0/0e/Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Shield of Shielding image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png/300px-Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Shield_of_Shielding_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Shield of Shielding</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shield</a> that allows the wearer to cast <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(spell)\" title=\"Shield (spell)\">Shield</a> and use <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Bash\" title=\"Shield Bash\">Shield Bash</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Named in the style of Extremely Unimaginative Jimmy, the geographer and interior decorator who named the 'waterfall' and the 'fireplace'.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n <div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: +2\">+2</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/38px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/50px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shields\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shields_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 190 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  190  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_OfShielding_Shield</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfShielding_Shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfShielding_Shield\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">dfeaa5fd-1f87-4f99-85b0-8f49664d691f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dfeaa5fd-1f87-4f99-85b0-8f49664d691f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dfeaa5fd-1f87-4f99-85b0-8f49664d691f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_OfShielding_Shield</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfShielding_Shield+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfShielding_Shield+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Blow\" title=\"Shield Blow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/60px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/80px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield Blow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Blow\" title=\"Shield Blow\">Shield Blow</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>When a foe hits you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></span>, unless they succeed a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a>. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(spell)\" title=\"Shield (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/60px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/80px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(spell)\" title=\"Shield (spell)\">Shield</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 1 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;796&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1159</span>: Can be found inside the <b>Offerings to Helm</b> Chest in the basement, which can in turn be reached by entering the secret hatch in the corner of the tabernacle</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The basement can be reached by entering the secret hatch in the corner of the tabernacle.</li>\n<li>Looting any of the items from the offering chests curses you with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Castigated_By_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Castigated By Divinity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Castigated By Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Castigated_By_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Castigated By Divinity (Condition)\">Castigated By Divinity</a>.</li>\n<li><i>\"Shield of Shielding\"</i> is a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/gravityfalls/comments/192rv8o/new_goty_dd_game_referenced_dungeons_dungeons_and/\">reference</a> to a Dungeons &amp; Dragons item which appears in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gravityfalls.fandom.com/wiki/Gravity_Falls_(TV_series)\">Gravity Falls</a>, specifically, in the episode <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gravityfalls.fandom.com/wiki/Dungeons,_Dungeons,_and_More_Dungeons\">\"Dungeons, Dungeons, and More Dungeons\"</a>, and is part of a larger parody of the game.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2518/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42878/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13524/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1330282/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclu